@echo off
rem asight collector: launcher for OpenCode Desktop on Windows (RFC 4.8 s2.4), written by the start-menu opt-in
rem item of `asight on opencode --opt-in opencode.desktop`. Your Start-menu and desktop shortcuts start this
rem instead of the app itself: it sets this form's kernel listener and runs the real app. An HTTPS_PROXY the shell
rem already set is your choice for that run and is not overridden (that run is not captured). `asight off opencode`
rem removes it.
if not defined HTTPS_PROXY set "HTTPS_PROXY=__ASIGHT_PROXY__"
"__ASIGHT_REAL_BINARY__" %*
